{
 "fragments": [
  {
   "begin": "0.000",
   "children": [],
   "end": "7.360",
   "id": "f000001",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "At ten years old,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "7.360",
   "children": [],
   "end": "10.240",
   "id": "f000002",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I could not figure out what it was"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "10.240",
   "children": [],
   "end": "12.200",
   "id": "f000003",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that this Elvis Presley guy had"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "12.200",
   "children": [],
   "end": "15.160",
   "id": "f000004",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that the rest of us boys did not have."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "15.160",
   "children": [],
   "end": "18.200",
   "id": "f000005",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "He seemed to be no different from the rest of us."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "18.200",
   "children": [],
   "end": "19.560",
   "id": "f000006",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "He was simply a man"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "19.560",
   "children": [],
   "end": "23.280",
   "id": "f000007",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "who had a head, two arms and two legs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "23.280",
   "children": [],
   "end": "25.680",
   "id": "f000008",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "It must have been something pretty superlative"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "25.680",
   "children": [],
   "end": "27.800",
   "id": "f000009",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that he had hidden away,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "27.800",
   "children": [],
   "end": "29.440",
   "id": "f000010",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "because he had every young girl"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "29.440",
   "children": [],
   "end": "33.480",
   "id": "f000011",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "at the orphanage wrapped around his little finger."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "33.480",
   "children": [],
   "end": "35.720",
   "id": "f000012",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "At about nine o'clock on Saturday morning,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "35.720",
   "children": [],
   "end": "37.320",
   "id": "f000013",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I figured a good solution was"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "37.320",
   "children": [],
   "end": "39.440",
   "id": "f000014",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "to ask Eugene Correthers,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "39.440",
   "children": [],
   "end": "42.400",
   "id": "f000015",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "who was one of the older and smarter boys,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "42.400",
   "children": [],
   "end": "46.040",
   "id": "f000016",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "what it was that made this Elvis guy so special."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "46.040",
   "children": [],
   "end": "46.680",
   "id": "f000017",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "He told me"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "46.680",
   "children": [],
   "end": "50.000",
   "id": "f000018",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that it was not anything about Elvis's personality,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "50.000",
   "children": [],
   "end": "55.200",
   "id": "f000019",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "but his wavy hair, and the way he moved his body."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "55.200",
   "children": [],
   "end": "56.880",
   "id": "f000020",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "About a half an hour later,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "56.880",
   "children": [],
   "end": "58.000",
   "id": "f000021",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "the boys in the orphanage,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "58.000",
   "children": [],
   "end": "60.720",
   "id": "f000022",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "called down to the main dining room by the matron,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "60.720",
   "children": [],
   "end": "61.200",
   "id": "f000023",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "were told"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "61.200",
   "children": [],
   "end": "64.160",
   "id": "f000024",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that they were all going to downtown Jacksonville, Florida"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "64.160",
   "children": [],
   "end": "68.240",
   "id": "f000025",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "to get a new pair of Buster Brown shoes and a haircut."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "68.240",
   "children": [],
   "end": "70.880",
   "id": "f000026",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "That is when I got this big idea,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "70.880",
   "children": [],
   "end": "73.680",
   "id": "f000027",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "which hit me like a ton of bricks."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "73.680",
   "children": [],
   "end": "76.720",
   "id": "f000028",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "If the Elvis haircut was the big secret,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "76.720",
   "children": [],
   "end": "80.400",
   "id": "f000029",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "then Elvis's haircut I was going to get."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "80.400",
   "children": [],
   "end": "82.960",
   "id": "f000030",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I was going to have my day in the sun,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "82.960",
   "children": [],
   "end": "86.600",
   "id": "f000031",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "and all the way to town that was all I talked about."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "86.600",
   "children": [],
   "end": "89.360",
   "id": "f000032",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "The fact that I was getting an Elvis haircut,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "89.360",
   "children": [],
   "end": "92.600",
   "id": "f000033",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "not just the simple fact that we were getting out of the orphanage,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "92.600",
   "children": [],
   "end": "96.240",
   "id": "f000034",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "made me particularly loquacious."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "96.240",
   "children": [],
   "end": "97.920",
   "id": "f000035",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I told everybody,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "97.920",
   "children": [],
   "end": "101.480",
   "id": "f000036",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "including the orphanage matron I normally feared,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "101.480",
   "children": [],
   "end": "105.200",
   "id": "f000037",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that I was going to look just like Elvis Presley"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "105.200",
   "children": [],
   "end": "109.040",
   "id": "f000038",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "and that I would learn to move around just like he did"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "109.040",
   "children": [],
   "end": "111.320",
   "id": "f000039",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "and that I would be rich and famous one day,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "111.320",
   "children": [],
   "end": "113.640",
   "id": "f000040",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "just like him."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "113.640",
   "children": [],
   "end": "115.080",
   "id": "f000041",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "The matron understood"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "115.080",
   "children": [],
   "end": "116.240",
   "id": "f000042",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "my idea was something"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "116.240",
   "children": [],
   "end": "120.480",
   "id": "f000043",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that I was really excited about and said nothing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "120.480",
   "children": [],
   "end": "122.600",
   "id": "f000044",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "When I got my new Buster Brown shoes,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "122.600",
   "children": [],
   "end": "125.440",
   "id": "f000045",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I was smiling from ear to ear."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "125.440",
   "children": [],
   "end": "128.720",
   "id": "f000046",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "Those shoes, they shined really brightly,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "128.720",
   "children": [],
   "end": "130.800",
   "id": "f000047",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "and I liked looking at the bones in my feet,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "130.800",
   "children": [],
   "end": "133.160",
   "id": "f000048",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "which I had never seen before,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "133.160",
   "children": [],
   "end": "134.520",
   "id": "f000049",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "through a special x-ray machine"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "134.520",
   "children": [],
   "end": "136.120",
   "id": "f000050",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "they had in the shoe store"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "136.120",
   "children": [],
   "end": "139.720",
   "id": "f000051",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that made the bones in your feet look green."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "139.720",
   "children": [],
   "end": "141.080",
   "id": "f000052",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I was now almost ready"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "141.080",
   "children": [],
   "end": "144.320",
   "id": "f000053",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "to go back to the orphanage and practice being like the man"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "144.320",
   "children": [],
   "end": "146.560",
   "id": "f000054",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "who all the girls loved,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "146.560",
   "children": [],
   "end": "150.240",
   "id": "f000055",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "since I had my new Buster Brown shoes."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "150.240",
   "children": [],
   "end": "152.440",
   "id": "f000056",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "It was the new haircut, though,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "152.440",
   "children": [],
   "end": "155.600",
   "id": "f000057",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that I needed to complete my new look."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "155.600",
   "children": [],
   "end": "160.040",
   "id": "f000058",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "We finally arrived at the unassuming, unembellished barbershop,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "160.040",
   "children": [],
   "end": "161.400",
   "id": "f000059",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "where they cut our hair for free"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "161.400",
   "children": [],
   "end": "163.760",
   "id": "f000060",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "because we were orphans."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "163.760",
   "children": [],
   "end": "166.800",
   "id": "f000061",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "Even though we were supposed to slowly wait to be called,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "166.800",
   "children": [],
   "end": "170.680",
   "id": "f000062",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I ran straight up to one of the barber chairs and climbed up onto the board"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "170.680",
   "children": [],
   "end": "175.640",
   "id": "f000063",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "the barber placed across the arms to make me sit up higher."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "175.640",
   "children": [],
   "end": "177.440",
   "id": "f000064",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I looked at the man and said,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "177.440",
   "children": [],
   "end": "180.040",
   "id": "f000065",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "with a beaming smile on my face,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "180.040",
   "children": [],
   "end": "181.200",
   "id": "f000066",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "'I want an Elvis haircut."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "181.200",
   "children": [],
   "end": "185.680",
   "id": "f000067",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "Can you make my hair like Elvis's?' I asked."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "185.680",
   "children": [],
   "end": "186.600",
   "id": "f000068",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "The barber,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "186.600",
   "children": [],
   "end": "188.920",
   "id": "f000069",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "who was a genial young man,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "188.920",
   "children": [],
   "end": "190.360",
   "id": "f000070",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "grinned back at me and said"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "190.360",
   "children": [],
   "end": "192.720",
   "id": "f000071",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that he would try his best."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "192.720",
   "children": [],
   "end": "193.560",
   "id": "f000072",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "I was so happy"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "193.560",
   "children": [],
   "end": "195.760",
   "id": "f000073",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "when he started to cut my hair,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "195.760",
   "children": [],
   "end": "197.040",
   "id": "f000074",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "but just as he started to cut,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "197.040",
   "children": [],
   "end": "202.680",
   "id": "f000075",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "the matron, who had been watching me and had a look as cold as ice,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "202.680",
   "children": [],
   "end": "203.200",
   "id": "f000076",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "motioned for him"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "203.200",
   "children": [],
   "end": "204.800",
   "id": "f000077",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "to come over to where she was standing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "204.800",
   "children": [],
   "end": "207.680",
   "id": "f000078",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "She whispered something into his ear"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "207.680",
   "children": [],
   "end": "209.240",
   "id": "f000079",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that caused the barber"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "209.240",
   "children": [],
   "end": "213.360",
   "id": "f000080",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "to shake his head, like he was telling her, 'No'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "213.360",
   "children": [],
   "end": "214.920",
   "id": "f000081",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "In response,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "214.920",
   "children": [],
   "end": "217.800",
   "id": "f000082",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "the matron walked over to a little man sitting in an office chair"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "217.800",
   "children": [],
   "end": "221.880",
   "id": "f000083",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that squeaked as it rolled around the floor and spoke to him."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "221.880",
   "children": [],
   "end": "222.840",
   "id": "f000084",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "It was the little man"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "222.840",
   "children": [],
   "end": "227.760",
   "id": "f000085",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "who then walked over and said something to the man who was cutting my hair."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "227.760",
   "children": [],
   "end": "229.520",
   "id": "f000086",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "The next thing I knew,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "229.520",
   "children": [],
   "end": "229.760",
   "id": "f000087",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "the man"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "229.760",
   "children": [],
   "end": "231.000",
   "id": "f000088",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "who was cutting my hair told me"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "231.000",
   "children": [],
   "end": "232.520",
   "id": "f000089",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that he was no longer allowed"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "232.520",
   "children": [],
   "end": "234.720",
   "id": "f000090",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "to give me an Elvis cut."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "234.720",
   "children": [],
   "end": "237.280",
   "id": "f000091",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "'Why not?' I cried desperately."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "237.280",
   "children": [],
   "end": "239.160",
   "id": "f000092",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "The kindly barber"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "239.160",
   "children": [],
   "end": "240.040",
   "id": "f000093",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "stopped by the matron"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "240.040",
   "children": [],
   "end": "240.760",
   "id": "f000094",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "did not answer,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "240.760",
   "children": [],
   "end": "242.840",
   "id": "f000095",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "but from his expression, I could tell"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "242.840",
   "children": [],
   "end": "244.920",
   "id": "f000096",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that he wished he could cut it as I had asked."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "244.920",
   "children": [],
   "end": "247.400",
   "id": "f000097",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "Within a few minutes,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "247.400",
   "children": [],
   "end": "250.480",
   "id": "f000098",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "it wasn't an Elvis haircut, but a short buzz cut"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "250.480",
   "children": [],
   "end": "251.640",
   "id": "f000099",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "that the barber had given me."
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "251.640",
   "children": [],
   "end": "257.760",
   "id": "f000100",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "When he finished shaving off all my hair and made me smell real good with his powder,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "257.760",
   "children": [],
   "end": "259.440",
   "id": "f000101",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
    "the barber handed me a nickel and told me"
   ]
  },
  {
   "begin": "259.440",
   "children": [],
   "end": "264.520",
   "id": "f000102",
   "language": "eng",
   "lines": [
